  "details": "If you are trying to edit your bio on the beta currently you might have come across the issue of the typing to be at the wrong place making it impossible to type in your bio or any other text field properly\nI’ve made a post on this before but it didn’t seem to get any traction also since all the beta features have been released to the main version this bug now effects it too\nHow to recreate it\n1. Open a text field (preferably one that already has text in it i.e. your bio)\n2. Try typing in it if nothing happens you have the glitch.\n3. Type a random character then you should be able to type again but the typing will only happen at the very beginning of your bio",
